/* Gamestage fonts, paper theme (GSUI-60).

   The paper theme names IBM Plex Sans for interface text and Instrument Serif
   for the numbers a player tracks. Neither is in the base pairing, so neither
   is on the page unless this stylesheet is, and a paper install without it
   falls through to system-ui and Georgia and reads as a recolour.

   Import once at the root, before gamestage-tokens.css. Hosts that control
   their own <head> should also add
     <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
   which a stylesheet cannot express. */
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap");
